# Issue #2697 proposal 9 (greenfield flag day): a writer-projection KEK level
# the request cites by digest (`k:` in x-known-manifests) travels as
# {levelDigest, containerManifestHistory}, so each containerKeks item is a
# full level or that stub. Remove these exact diagnostics as soon as main
# contains the new contract.
GET /containers/{containerId}/writer-projection added `subschema #1, subschema #2` to the `containerKeks/items/` response property `anyOf` list for the response status `200`

# Issue #2697 proposal 9: see above.
# Remove this exact diagnostic as soon as main contains the new contract.
GET /containers/{containerId}/writer-projection the `containerKeks/items/` response's property `type` changed from `object` to `any` for status `200`

# Issue #2697 proposal 9: see above.
# Remove this exact diagnostic as soon as main contains the new contract.
GET /containers/{containerId}/writer-projection removed the required property `containerKeks/items/accessManifestHash` from the response with the `200` status

# Issue #2697 proposal 9: see above.
# Remove this exact diagnostic as soon as main contains the new contract.
GET /containers/{containerId}/writer-projection removed the required property `containerKeks/items/containerId` from the response with the `200` status

